---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title={"Help & FAQ: Using the EyeCheck Online Eye Test"}>
	<div class="inner">
	<div class="wrap crumb">Home › Help</div>
	<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:860px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
	  <h1>Help &amp; FAQ</h1>
	  <p class="muted">[One line: answers about taking the test, results, privacy and organisations.]</p>
	  <label class="note" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px">Search questions<input type="search"></label>
	</section>
	
	<section class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px;padding-bottom:48px">
	  <nav class="toc" aria-label="Topics" style="flex:0 1 220px;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:10px">
	    <span class="eyebrow">Topics</span>
	    <a href="#">Taking the test</a><a href="#">Testing children</a><a href="#">Understanding results</a><a href="#">Privacy &amp; data</a><a href="#">Schools &amp; organisations</a><a href="#">Technical problems</a>
	  </nav>
	  <div style="flex:999 1 560px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px">
	    <div class="grp"><h2>Taking the test</h2>
	      <div class="faq"><span>What do I need to take the test?</span><span>+</span></div>
	      <div class="faq"><span>Can I take the test on my phone?</span><span>+</span></div>
	      <div class="faq"><span>Should I wear my glasses?</span><span>+</span></div>
	    </div>
	    <div class="grp"><h2>Testing children</h2>
	      <div class="faq"><span>What age can my child take the test?</span><span>+</span></div>
	      <div class="faq"><span>My child doesn’t know letters. Can they still take it?</span><span>+</span></div>
	    </div>
	    <div class="grp"><h2>Understanding results</h2>
	      <div class="faq"><span>What does 6/6 or 20/20 mean?</span><span>+</span></div>
	      <div class="faq"><span>My result says see an eye doctor. What now?</span><span>+</span></div>
	    </div>
	    <div class="grp"><h2>Privacy &amp; data</h2>
	      <div class="faq"><span>What data do you keep, and for how long?</span><span>+</span></div>
	      <div class="faq"><span>How do I unsubscribe from reminders?</span><span>+</span></div>
	    </div>
	    <div class="grp"><h2>Technical problems</h2>
	      <div class="faq"><span>The test won’t load or goes black. What can I do?</span><span>+</span></div>
	    </div>
	    <p class="muted">Still stuck? <a href="#">Contact us</a></p>
	  </div>
	</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
